      },
      "id": "93B816B7BE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "Now the Gowanus is particularly smelly -- I will admit it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B5CBA3B42B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "There are problems of sewage overflow and contamination, but I would also argue that almost every city has this exact condition, and it's a condition that we're all facing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F6D926B1B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "showing the contaminants in yellow and green",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D016B9DDC8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 145,
        "text": "And here's a map of that condition, showing the contaminants in yellow and green, exacerbated by this new flow of storm-surge and sea-level rise.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B0401279A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "So we really had a lot to deal with.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB8724C351",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "When we started this project, one of the core ideas was to look back in history and try to understand what was there.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AFADCFF419",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "incredible geographical signature of a series of islands",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9681FFF1A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 135,
        "endOffset": 209,
        "text": "matrix of salt marshes and beaches that served as natural wave attenuation",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CD4E77CA8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "And you can see from this map",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1B2408F62D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "We also learned at this time that you could eat an oyster about the size of a dinner plate in the Gowanus Canal itself.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9254A6F93C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "back-to-the-future",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D0F40A0EF1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "So our concept is really this back-to-the-future concept, harnessing the intelligence of that land settlement pattern.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2531E10B82",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "And the idea has two core stages.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D126C81961",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 24,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "artificial ecology",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68E03ED0F2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "reef",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CE6812ACF4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "One is to develop a new artificial ecology, a reef out in the harbor, that would then protect new settlement patterns inland and the Gowanus.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EEC3B65947",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 52,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "you can imagine",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2684C8B24",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "Because if you have cleaner water and slower water, you can imagine a new way of living with that water.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9C26CDCFC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "So the project really addresses these three core issues in a new and exciting way, I think.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9093F766A4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
